+## Architecture Overview
+
+### System Design
+MusicCat (Tonebox) is a FastAPI-based music education management platform with the following layered architecture:
+
+```
+┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
+│                  API Layer (Routers)                │
+│  /auth  /rooms  /lessons  /bookings  /instructors  │
+├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
+│                 Service Layer                        │
+│  lesson_booking  booking_manager  instructor_mgr   │
+├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
+│                  Model Layer                        │
+│  User  Instructor  Lesson  Booking  StudioRoom     │
+├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
+│               Database Layer (SQLAlchemy)           │
+│                   Async MySQL/SQLite                │
+└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
+```
+
+### Core Modules
+
+| Module | Responsibility | Key Files |
+|--------|----------------|-----------|
+| `music_accounts` | Authentication & User Management | [account_auth.py](file:///app/music_accounts/account_auth.py) |
+| `music_rooms` | Studio Room Management | [room_manager.py](file:///app/music_rooms/room_manager.py) |
+| `music_lessons` | Lesson CRUD Operations | [lesson_manager.py](file:///app/music_lessons/lesson_manager.py) |
+| `music_staff` | Instructor Management | [instructor_manager.py](file:///app/music_staff/instructor_manager.py) |
+| `music_bookings` | Booking & Reservation | [booking_manager.py](file:///app/music_bookings/booking_manager.py) |
+| `lesson_schedule` | Scheduling & Conflict Detection | [lesson_booking.py](file:///app/lesson_schedule/lesson_booking.py) |
+
+### Data Flow
+1. **Scheduling Flow**: `TeacherAvailability` → `LessonBooking.check_time_conflict()` → `OldLesson/Lesson`
+2. **Booking Flow**: `User` → `Booking` → `Lesson`/`StudioRoom`
+3. **Authentication Flow**: `X-API-Key` header → `get_current_user()` → Role-based access control
+
+### Technology Stack
+- **Framework**: FastAPI
+- **ORM**: SQLAlchemy (async)
+- **Database**: MySQL/SQLite
+- **Auth**: API Key-based authentication
+
+### Dual Model Strategy
+The system maintains two parallel model sets:
+- **Legacy Models**: `OldLesson`, `User`, `Instrument` - traditional one-to-one teaching
+- **Modern Models**: `Lesson`, `Instructor`, `Booking` - flexible group lessons and room bookings
